learnings:
  - Two independent reviewers (general + security) on security-critical kernel code found disjoint real bugs; the builder alone shipped a tamper-downgrade path and tests that could not fail.
  - Ask reviewers to judge whether each test can fail; 'the test passes' is not evidence when the test is hollow.
